      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Metadata rewriting",
      "items": [
        "Names, labels and metadata are rewritten so Pods from different vClusters never collide in the host namespace",
        "Only Pods, Services, Ingresses, PVCs and referenced ConfigMaps/Secrets flow vCluster -> Host"
